IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-ULTRA-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIM-D               PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 NUM-LAYERS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PRUNE-TARGET-PCT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-ULTRA-V2.
    IF DIM-D == 0 OR NUM-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 52 TO SNR-DB.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-LAYERS.
    WEIGHT 30 SNR-DB.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
